    question: 'Can I work while collecting Social Security benefits?',
    answer: 'Yes. If you are below Full Retirement Age in 2026, the Retirement Earnings Test withholds $1 for every $2 earned above $24,480. In the calendar year you reach FRA, $1 is withheld for every $3 earned above $65,160 before your birthday month. Once you reach FRA, earnings limits disappear entirely, and withheld funds are recalculated upward.',
