  <div class="ssb-tool-container" id="calculator">
    <Alert type="info" title="Official 2026 SSA Formula Engine">
      This calculator uses the official 2026 bend points ($1,286 / $7,749) published under <a href="https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/42/415" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">42 U.S. Code § 415</a>. For an exact computation using your year-by-year IRS tax transcripts, check your <a href="https://www.ssa.gov/myaccount/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">official my Social Security account</a>.
    </Alert>

    <form id="benefits-form" class="ssb-form">
      <div class="ssb-form-grid">
